- Possible Arrays, for the "Sample Case" are as follows: 
- {1, 1, 1, 1, 1}
- {2, 1, 1, 1, 1}
- {2, 2, 1, 1, 1} 
- {2, 2, 2, 1, 1}
- {2, 2, 2, 2, 1}
- {2, 2, 2, 2, 2}
- Hence, the answer to the "Sample Case" is $6$ ($6$ % ($10^9$ $+$ $7$)).

